# CLAUDE.local.md — personal notes (gitignored; copy this file to CLAUDE.local.md)

Personal, per-machine context for Claude Code. Never keys, tokens, webhook URLs or credential values — those live in `.env` (also gitignored) and in Tines.

## My tenant and team

- `TINES_TENANT=<your-tenant>` — host prefix only (the part before `.tines.com`)
- `MY_DEV_TEAM_ID=0` — the dev team id from `stories/_manifest.yaml: environments.dev.team_id`
- Dev folder for my builds: `<folder name>` (folder id in the manifest)

