## Reminders to myself

- Run `/tines-connect` after switching tenants; an empty tool list means the OAuth session lapsed.
- `source .env` before any skill that needs `TINES_TENANT`; the skills never read `.env` themselves.
- Record any `/mcp` tool names my client shows in `docs/VERIFY.md` item 1.
